WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.462
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Google Drive: Share and Work Together.

2
00:00:06.762 --> 00:00:12.456
Save online and work with others on one document. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:19.797
Step one. Click New, then File upload, and choose a file. Your file is now saved online.

4
00:00:20.783 --> 00:00:26.724
Step two. Double-click the file to open it with Google Docs. Your work saves automatically.

5
00:00:27.717 --> 00:00:36.351
Step three. Click Share. Type your friend's email and choose Editor, if they can change it, or Viewer, if they can only read.

6
00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:45.093
Step four. Select some text, click Comment, and write your idea. Other people can reply. This is how teams work together.

7
00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:49.711
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:50.011 --> 00:00:52.161
Upload a file to Google Drive.

9
00:00:52.461 --> 00:00:54.890
Share a document with a friend as Viewer.

10
00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:57.178
Write one comment in the document.

11
00:00:57.478 --> 00:00:58.700
Well done!

